  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:15.850" end="00:17.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Who ride with ya and who'd stay? (Who'd stay?)</p>
      <p begin="00:17.640" end="00:19.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Who'd die for ya and who'd wait? (Who'd wait?)</p>
      <p begin="00:19.640" end="00:21.180" ttm:agent="v1">Bullets fly, steady kicking, Bruce Wayne</p>
      <p begin="00:21.180" end="00:23.150" ttm:agent="v1">.45 on my side for a pussy, move weight</p>
      <p begin="00:23.150" end="00:24.650" ttm:agent="v1">Boy, I promise I won't lie to ya</p>
      <p begin="00:24.450" end="00:25.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm getting paper (paper)</p>
      <p begin="00:25.570" end="00:27.520" ttm:agent="v1">Noose tied, but my time is never wasted</p>
      <p begin="00:27.520" end="00:29.020" ttm:agent="v1">Heard you wanna get by, ain't no way</p>
      <p begin="00:28.910" end="00:30.510" ttm:agent="v1">If you push up on me, boy, I let the choppa get a plate</p>
      <p begin="00:30.510" end="00:34.040" ttm:agent="v1">I smoke the blunt, I'm gettin' high, lil' boy, I'm fired up</p>
      <p begin="00:34.040" end="00:37.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">It's a hard life, but bitch, I promise that ain't mine (that ain't mine)</p>
      <p begin="00:37.870" end="00:41.920" ttm:agent="v1">I'm steppin' over money like I'm workin' over time, bruh</p>
      <p begin="00:41.920" end="00:45.320" ttm:agent="v1">Wake up, count it up, and feel the sun up in my eyes</p>
      <p begin="00:45.320" end="00:47.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Watch the smoke up in the sky (sky, sky)</p>
      <p begin="00:47.330" end="00:48.830" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I'm livid</p>
      <p begin="00:48.510" end="00:50.270" ttm:agent="v1">Tote fire incase a mother ****er trippin'</p>
      <p begin="00:50.270" end="00:52.020" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I'm in the ride, slide by with a semi</p>
      <p begin="00:52.020" end="00:54.030" ttm:agent="v1">Know my lifestyle, it be gettin' to my mental</p>
      <p begin="00:54.030" end="00:55.930" ttm:agent="v1">Something in this tree got my memory slippin'</p>
      <p begin="00:55.930" end="00:58.080" ttm:agent="v1">40 OZ's in the bag, and I flip it</p>
      <p begin="00:58.080" end="00:59.950" ttm:agent="v1">If you want war, bullets fly any second</p>
      <p begin="00:59.950" end="01:03.890" ttm:agent="v1">Pocket watchin', bitch, like every year I get a million, bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:03.890" end="01:06.340" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, lil' bitch, I'm gassed up</p>
      <p begin="01:06.340" end="01:10.090" ttm:agent="v1">Passed out off them drugs, I done took the fast route</p>
      <p begin="01:10.090" end="01:11.590" ttm:agent="v1">Bi-bitch, I'm in your city</p>
      <p begin="01:11.570" end="01:13.580" ttm:agent="v1">Count it up, I'm thumbin' 50s</p>
      <p begin="01:13.580" end="01:15.580" ttm:agent="v1">Up and stuck, this shit get shifty</p>
      <p begin="01:15.580" end="01:18.000" ttm:agent="v1">Watch this drum, knock back, get lifted, lift 'em</p>
      <p begin="01:18.000" end="01:19.930" ttm:agent="v1">Dizzy, spinnin', pitty drivin'</p>
      <p begin="01:19.930" end="01:21.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Jeans, 2K, don't fit me (fit me)</p>
      <p begin="01:21.870" end="01:23.370" ttm:agent="v1">Whatever I say, I live it</p>
      <p begin="01:23.360" end="01:26.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Fit handmade, this shit ain't thrifted, damn (damn)</p>
      <p begin="01:26.160" end="01:27.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Who ride with ya and who'd stay? (Who'd stay?)</p>
      <p begin="01:27.910" end="01:30.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Who'd die for ya and who'd wait? (Who'd wait?)</p>
      <p begin="01:30.040" end="01:31.540" ttm:agent="v1">Bullets fly, steady kicking, Bruce Wayne</p>
      <p begin="01:31.420" end="01:33.470" ttm:agent="v1">.45 on my side for a pussy, move weight</p>
      <p begin="01:33.470" end="01:34.970" ttm:agent="v1">Boy, I promise I won't lie to ya</p>
      <p begin="01:34.710" end="01:36.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm getting paper (paper)</p>
      <p begin="01:35.950" end="01:37.680" ttm:agent="v1">Noose tied, but my time is never wasted</p>
      <p begin="01:37.680" end="01:39.230" ttm:agent="v1">Heard you wanna get by, ain't no way</p>
      <p begin="01:39.230" end="01:40.730" ttm:agent="v1">If you push up on me, boy, I let the choppa get a plate</p>
      <p begin="01:40.690" end="01:44.450" ttm:agent="v1">I smoke the blunt, I'm gettin' high, lil' boy, I'm fired up</p>
      <p begin="01:44.450" end="01:48.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">It's a hard life, but bitch, I promise that ain't mine (that ain't mine)</p>
      <p begin="01:48.060" end="01:52.010" ttm:agent="v1">I'm steppin' over money like I'm workin' over time, bruh</p>
      <p begin="01:52.010" end="01:55.480" ttm:agent="v1">Wake up, count it up, and feel the sun up in my eyes</p>
      <p begin="01:55.480" end="01:59.480" ttm:agent="v1">Watch the smoke up in the sky</p>
